    "title": "Private Villa vs 5-Star Resort: Which Is Better for Luxury Family Travel?",
    "excerpt": "The ultimate luxury family travel debate: total privacy of a private villa versus world-class amenities of a five-star resort. We compare both across six key dimensions with real family experiences.",
    "date": "2026-05-04",
